GZ = S("directly at the camera, just past the camera, slightly above the camera, slightly below the camera, to the left of the camera, to the right of the camera, over the shoulder, down at the hands, down at the floor, up at the sky, up at the ceiling, far into the distance, at something off-frame, out of a window, at a book, at a phone, at a mirror, at another person, at a drink, at the horizon, at the ground ahead, at the viewer from the corner of the eye, back toward the camera with a head turn, away from the camera, into the light, away from the light, at the flame of a candle, at falling rain, at passing traffic, at a crowd, at a reflection")
