TW = S("a straight upright spine, a gentle S-curve in the spine, a slight arch in the lower back, a pronounced back arch, a forward slouch, a relaxed slump, a hunched forward posture, a torso twisted toward the camera, a torso twisted away from the camera, a torso turned to the left, a torso turned to the right, shoulders turned one way and hips the other, a body angled three-quarters to the camera, a body in full profile, a body facing straight on, a body turned away looking back, a side bend to the left, a side bend to the right, a forward fold, a backbend, a contrapposto stance, a pelvis shifted to one side, a head tilted to one side, a head tipped back, a head dropped forward, a chin lifted, a chin tucked, shoulders rolled back, shoulders hunched up, shoulders relaxed down, a leaning torso, a rotated upper body")
